{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret of the Boarding House</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you play as a journalist determined to uncover one of the darkest secrets of the Soviet past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your protagonist sets out to investigate an abandoned boarding house to discover the truth behind the mysterious disappearances of children that took place there decades ago \u2014 and to finish his article. However, he never reaches his destination: a car accident cuts the journey short. When he regains consciousness, the journalist finds himself inside an unfinished building on the boarding house grounds. Now he must traverse dark corridors filled with nightmares, uncover chilling secrets from the past, and fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>A story of grim secrets from the past</strong> \u2014 uncover the mystery of the missing children and learn what the boarding house was hiding during the Soviet era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/aa7519f79807d26b4eb5fff97fb669f5.poster.avif?t=1765450643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/aa7519f79807d26b4eb5fff97fb669f5.webm?t=1765450643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/aa7519f79807d26b4eb5fff97fb669f5.mp4?t=1765450643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong>Unique monsters with different behaviors</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Listener (Object No. 3142)</strong> \u2014 a creature with heightened hearing, reacting to footsteps, noises, and any interaction with objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Watcher (Object No. 5454)</strong> \u2014 can see the player from afar but is completely deaf to sounds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutated monster with a hallucination aura (Object No. 7319)</strong> \u2014 inflicts terrifying visions on the player and drags them closer, leaving no chance of escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mimic Spider (Object No. 9921)</strong> \u2014 crawls across floors, walls, and ceilings, startling the player in the most unexpected places.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Exploration and survival</strong> \u2014 search for notes, keys, and resources to progress further and unlock new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/ee1676261fad1906e141b0f119b075f6.poster.avif?t=1765450643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/ee1676261fad1906e141b0f119b075f6.webm?t=1765450643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/ee1676261fad1906e141b0f119b075f6.mp4?t=1765450643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Atmosphere of fear</strong> \u2014 hallucinations, jump scares, and tense sound design will never let you feel safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/9fb89b84223338bea8d785a756e88efc.poster.avif?t=1765450643\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/9fb89b84223338bea8d785a756e88efc.webm?t=1765450643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/extras/9fb89b84223338bea8d785a756e88efc.mp4?t=1765450643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Cinematic storytelling</strong> \u2014 the narrative unfolds gradually: from the car accident and first steps inside the unfinished building to the final encounter with the secret hidden in the boarding house basement.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008850?t=1765450643","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008850?t=1765450643","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/9dd660cf31fa0e04e55cf4895a1960ad6145cb30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765450643","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008850/9dd660cf31fa0e04e55cf4895a1960ad6145cb30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765450643","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret of the Boarding House</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you play as a journalist determined to uncover one of the darkest secrets of the Soviet past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your protagonist sets out to investigate an abandoned boarding house to discover the truth behind the mysterious disappearances of children that took place there decades ago \u2014 and to finish his article. However, he never reaches his destination: a car accident cuts the journey sho